# Configuration for xvd. All variables are optional and have sane defaults,
# so the tool runs immediately after `uv sync` with no .env file at all.
#
# Precedence: --output-dir flag > environment variable > default.

# Where finished video files are written.
# Default: the current working directory.
# The directory is created if it does not exist.
XVD_OUTPUT_DIR=.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Accepted post hostnames (NOT configurable -- listed here for reference only).
#
# The allowlist is deliberately compiled into backend/validation.py rather than
# read from the environment. It is the Constitution Principle V boundary, and a
# security control that can be widened by an environment variable is not a
# security control. All eight, matched exactly:
#
#   x.com            www.x.com            m.x.com            mobile.x.com
#   twitter.com      www.twitter.com      m.twitter.com      mobile.twitter.com
#
# Rejected: t.co and other shorteners, any .onion mirror, and look-alike hosts
# such as x.com.evil.net.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
